    "b-architecture-the-server-talks-to-help-4": {
      "id": "b-architecture-the-server-talks-to-help-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The server talks to helpers over bounded JSON-lines pipes. Models warm at startup and stay loaded. The client contains no model helpers; it never starts or stops the server. Bun manages the JavaScript dependencies and compiles the server into a standalone executable. The native application and inference server have no Python runtime dependency. The Codecaine archive worker and Data viewer require Python 3.12 or later."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-a-recording-5": {
      "id": "b-architecture-a-recording-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "A recording"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-the-client-asks-the-serv-6": {
      "id": "b-architecture-the-client-asks-the-serv-6",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The client asks the server to create a generation with its device identity. The server freezes shared settings and accepts independent uploads from any connected client. Offline or unavailable speech recognition prevents capture. Other recordings in progress do not."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-the-client-pins-its-micr-7": {
      "id": "b-architecture-the-client-pins-its-micr-7",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The client pins its microphone and uploads acknowledged, sequenced PCM chunks while recording. Inference audio is mono 16 kHz float32; optional original audio keeps the microphone rate/channels as float32."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-release-stops-capture-d-8": {
      "id": "b-architecture-release-stops-capture-d-8",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Release stops capture, drains uploads, and sends final frame counts. The microphone is available for the next take while earlier uploads finish. The server checks the complete intervals and seals WAV files. Recordings must be 0.25–180 seconds."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-the-server-runs-whisper-9": {
      "id": "b-architecture-the-server-runs-whisper-9",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Sealed recordings enter a FIFO processing queue. One job at a time runs Whisper, mechanical cleanup, dictionary rules, and list formatting. Optional Qwen output passes through dictionary rules and deterministic rewrite checks. Rejection or proofreading failure retains the pre-proofreading text. Cancelling one upload or queued job does not interrupt another."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-ndjson-events-carry-prog-10": {
      "id": "b-architecture-ndjson-events-carry-prog-10",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "NDJSON events carry progress and the saved final result for each generation. Each pending client take retains its original server connection and destination. The client serializes delivery attempts, verifies focus/caret safety, and reports each outcome separately from inference completion."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-architecture-interrupted-partial-uplo-11": {
      "id": "b-architecture-interrupted-partial-uplo-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Interrupted partial uploads expire; a complete upload can finish after the client disconnects. Pending takes recover interrupted event streams by checking their saved generation and reconnecting. Opening history never pastes an old result. Restarting the server marks unfinished generations failed and retains completed history. There is no offline capture queue or automatic audio-upload retry."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "architecture-activation-modes": {
      "id": "architecture-activation-modes",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Trigger",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " setting under "
        },
        {
          "insert": "This Mac",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " selects how the dictation key starts a take. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Hold to talk",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " records while the key is held. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Double tap to toggle",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " starts recording on a double tap and ends it on a second double tap."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
